From: rakesh chanda <rakesh.chanda@adtran.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 13:19:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: keep multicast traffic on the CPU path

The receive path no longer calls the multicast handler, so the CPU
forwards multicast traffic. The SFU path keeps its call.

Signed-off-by: rakesh chanda <rakesh.chanda@adtran.com>
---

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/arht_dp_api.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/arht_dp_api.c
@@ -1370,9 +1370,6 @@ static void airoha_get_entry_bind(u32 ms
 				flow_e->ingress_dev_idx = ETH2;
 		}
 		airoha_ppe_check_skb(&eth->ppe->dev, q->skb, hash, reason, false);
-		if(arht_xpon_igmp_sfu_enable_hook == NULL){
-			arht_ppe_multicast_handler(eth->ppe, q->skb);
-		}
 
 	} else {
 		if (!eth->npu) {			
